      "data": {
        "text": "**Initiating Project Workflow**\n\nI've initiated the project by focusing on the core file, `fetch_api_key.py`. My primary objective now is to set up this initial module for the interaction. I am preparing to implement this first file using a Microsoft or OpenAI integration and am keeping the external provider clearly identifiable in the script. I am moving forward file by file.\n\n\n**Defining Secret Management Files**\n\nI'm now diving into the specifics. For the `fetch_api_key.py` module, I've decided on Azure Key Vault from Microsoft as the secret management service. I'll be using the `azure-keyvault-secrets` SDK to facilitate the implementation. I'm focusing on making the external provider, Azure Key Vault, very clearly identifiable within the script's structure. I'm now starting to create `fetch_api_key.py`.\n\n\n",
