      "data": {
        "text": "**Constructing Monitoring Script**\n\nI'm now focusing on creating the scored files for the later steps, beginning with `rotation_summary.py`. My primary approach involves utilizing Datadog for comprehensive monitoring and summarizing the status of secret rotations. This script should provide a clear overview.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789969297246,
          "start": 1789969297190
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
